{"id":"378dfa121b0216f8","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability.md","title":"六类 CFG 语义问题不可判定","display":"thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability — 六类 CFG 语义问题不可判定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability"],"display":"thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability — 六类 CFG 语义问题不可判定","depends_on":["[[73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems]]","[[73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity]]","[[73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl]]","[[73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability]]","[[73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence]]","[[73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.5.2–9.5.4, Theorems 9.20–9.22 and Exercise 9.5.2, print pp. 413–418; PDF pp. 435–440","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability — 六类 CFG 语义问题不可判定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38a6929b52694b0f\" href=\"?note=38a6929b52694b0f\" title=\"73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems\">73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4eb90c09079841ed\" href=\"?note=4eb90c09079841ed\" title=\"73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity\">73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65f79fdc4c47ee8b\" href=\"?note=65f79fdc4c47ee8b\" title=\"73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl\">73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"749da0bcf0da6c50\" href=\"?note=749da0bcf0da6c50\" title=\"73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"33e207bac16abe1a\" href=\"?note=33e207bac16abe1a\" title=\"73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence\">73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"68b47b6e126cab37\" href=\"?note=68b47b6e126cab37\" title=\"73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure\">73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.5.2–9.5.4, Theorems 9.20–9.22 and Exercise 9.5.2, print pp. 413–418; PDF pp. 435–440"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>六种二进制语言采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"38a6929b52694b0f\" href=\"?note=38a6929b52694b0f\" title=\"73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems\">73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems</a> 的代码与字母表条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathsf{AMBCFG},\\mathsf{INTCFG},\\mathsf{UNIVCFG},\\mathsf{EQCFG},\\mathsf{INCLCFG},\\mathsf{REGCFG}\\}\n\\cap\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\mathsf{AMBCFG},\\mathsf{INTCFG},\\mathsf{UNIVCFG},\\mathsf{EQCFG},\\mathsf{INCLCFG},\\mathsf{REGCFG}\\}\n\\cap\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>AMB 与交非空直接用两列表文法。令 K=(T*∖L_A)∪(T*∖L_B)，两补都是 CFL；K=T* 当且仅当 PCP 无解，因而全称性、与 T* 文法的等价及 T*⊆K 都不可判定。对正则性：无解时 K=T*；有解时取一个公共词 wα，w 属二进制字符、α 属索引字符，逆同态 0↦w、1↦α 把 T*∖K 拉回 {0ⁿ1ⁿ:n≥1}。若 K 正则，其补及逆同态也应正则，矛盾。所有变换在明确 CFG 代码上可计算；没有把不可判定误称为不在 NP。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems","status":"resolved","id":"38a6929b52694b0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"4eb90c09079841ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-pcp-to-cfg-ambiguity]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl","status":"resolved","id":"65f79fdc4c47ee8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-pcp-list-complement-dcfl]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability","status":"resolved","id":"749da0bcf0da6c50","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"33e207bac16abe1a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure","status":"resolved","id":"68b47b6e126cab37","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfl-closure-and-nonclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems","status":"resolved","id":"38a6929b52694b0f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"六种二进制语言采用 [[73-df-coded-cfg-semantic-problems]] 的代码与字母表条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\{\\mathsf{AMBCFG},\\mathsf{INTCFG},\\mathsf{UNIVCFG},\\mathsf{EQCFG},\\mathsf{INCLCFG},\\mathsf{REGCFG}\\}\n\\cap\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1831,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-semantic-undecidability|六类 CFG 语义问题不可判定]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"0c6487c88a983213","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["38a6929b52694b0f","4eb90c09079841ed","65f79fdc4c47ee8b","749da0bcf0da6c50","33e207bac16abe1a","68b47b6e126cab37","004d4e2ba3fdd14e"]}